    "show_share": true,
    "description": "Aga Khan University President Dr Sulaiman Shahabuddin and Provost Dr Carl Amrhein paid a courtesy call to the Commission for University Education (CUE) to meet the new Chief Executive Officer Prof Mike Kuria. They were accompanied by Prof Alfred Mutema who is a friend of AKU.",
